				"code" : "updateTilesFunction := [ | index |\r\t\"BTW this is bad, just inherit the BlElement from OSMTile so we don't have to introduce index variable.\"\r\tindex := 1.\r\r\taCanvassableElement\r\t\tchildrenDo: [ :child | \r\t\t\t(isBlElementVisible value: child)\r\t\t\t\tifTrue: [ child background: (tiles at: index) image ]\r\t\t\t\tifFalse: [ child background: Color lightGray ].\r\t\t\tindex := index + 1 ] ].\r\t\t\t\r\"Call the function\"\rupdateTilesFunction value."
